Hurry up, we have an emergency at Central Hospital! Many patients are waiting for your help!

This is a happy hospital time management game, where you can play as a doctor, nurse, and help patients. You can also play the role of a hospital administrator, building, maintaining, and managing your hospital.

Here you can get money by helping patients and upgrade the various facilities of the hospital to create a perfect medical center.

Game Features:
- There are hundreds of different level objectives, the content of the level is exciting, and you will not get bored;
- Doctors from various departments will appear in the level, and you can help various patients;
- Perfect hospital facility upgrade system, no matter how difficult the level can be easily passed;
- Decorate your hospital, you can design different styles of equipment to create your own hospital;
- The unique achievement collection system makes your game no longer monotonous;
- Rich activity rewards bring a more fulfilling sense of purpose.

Want to build a world-class hospital? This is the best place for your dreams to come true!

Happy Diner Story is a delicious, newly designed time management game. Start by running a small restaurant, upgrade your chef, waiters and cooking equipment, open restaurants in every city in the world, and write the story of your culinary empire.
Different from common cooking games, this game simulates the process from cooking to serving, completely simulating the restaurant management gameplay, allowing you to immersively participate in every aspect of cooking. From the moment a customer enters the restaurant, the operation of the restaurant begins. Assigning tables to customers, customers ordering meals, serving snacks to customers, chefs personally cooking for customers, etc., a series of processes will be presented in the game. You can also upgrade waiters and chefs to make them more efficient and faster; upgrade dishes to make the food more delicious; upgrade restaurant equipment to accommodate more customers. Don't miss out on every detail, creating the perfect restaurant starts here.
Game features:
- Newly designed gameplay. Different from traditional cooking games, the immersive simulation will fascinate you;
- Everything can be upgraded. The elements you see: chefs, waiters, equipment, tables and chairs, etc., can all be upgraded to make your cooking process more comfortable;
- Customized decoration. Restore the restaurant's decoration design one-to-one, carefully arrange the restaurant decoration, all the decorations you see have been carefully created by us;
- Surprising props. Want a more enjoyable pass? It doesn't matter, you can use props to make the waiter run faster and satisfy customers' dish requirements at any time. There are also many surprise props waiting for you to discover;
- Rich activities and gameplay. We will regularly open limited-time events and launch limited items in conjunction with current festivals to greatly enrich the game content;
Run your restaurant, discover delicious food from all over the world, and realize your dream of being a chef here.

Lisa is a famous designer. She had planned to return to her home town to reopen grandma's hotel. But when she returned, the hotel has become dilapidated. To make matters worse, she lost all her luggage and even found a baby in here! She's hungry and cold, please play the game to collect resources to help Lisa and repair her hotel. Complete her various interesting room designs to help people here live a better life! 

Gameplay:
Design personalized rooms for all kinds of people;
Solve challenging bubble puzzles; 
Uncover the story of the protagonist;
When you complete the cloakroom, you can unlock the costume play to dress Lisa and her dog guests;
And when Lucky Hotel is completed, you can unlock the town map, find "foster hill" and "mountain campground";
Unlock dog racing, hot air balloon race, simulation store and other gameplay...

We will regularly update the game content and provide rich furniture decoration.
Let's join the protagonist for an exciting story!

